crypto ./revsecurity ./revsecurity ./revsecurity
	# OpenSSL 3.5. Functions that OpenSSL 3 turned into macros are listed under
	# the names the macros call (EVP_CIPHER_get_key_length for
	# EVP_CIPHER_key_length, SSL_get1_peer_certificate for
	# SSL_get_peer_certificate and so on): those are the symbols code compiled
	# against the OpenSSL 3 headers references, and revsecurity exports.

